Portions of this software are derived from the Q.ANT Native Computing Toolkit
(https://github.com/Q-ANT-GmbH/qant_native_computing_toolkit, v2.4.0),
Copyright Q.ANT GmbH, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  - the driver ABI (struct layouts and function signatures) in crates/qant-sys
  - the algorithms for convolution lowering, pooling, batch normalisation and
    the photonic KAN layer in crates/qant/src/ops, and the CPU simulator,
    which were rewritten and extended (batching, dilation, groups, output
    padding, non-divisible adaptive pooling, bug fixes).

